. *********************************
. *** Apply sample restrictions ***
. *********************************
. 
. * We estimate the following regressions using a sample restricted to respondents with exactly one
>  child.
. * Note: There was a typo in the preliminary Stata code provided in the PAP. Although the verbal d
> escription 
. * of the sample restriction was correct, the code mistakenly included `parity2==1`, which would s
> elect 
. * respondents with at least two children—contradicting the intended analytic sample.
. 
. 
. keep if parity2!=1 // Hypotheses 1, 2, 3, 4
(10,999 observations deleted)

. 
. * Restrict the analyses to cohabiting couples 
. * keep if cohab==1 // Hypothesis 3
. 
